### ShopStream API walkthrough
# Run these one by one with the IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client (open this file and
# click the green arrows). Everything goes through the API gateway on :8080.
# Each service also has Swagger UI, e.g. http://localhost:8082/swagger-ui.html

@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Log in as the demo admin (the token is saved for the next requests)
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@shopstream.dev",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Who am I? (the gateway turns the JWT into an X-User-Id header)
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Browse the catalog (public, no token needed)
GET {{gateway}}/api/products?search=lamp&page=0&size=10

### 4. Categories
GET {{gateway}}/api/products/categories

### 5. Stock for product 4 (public)
GET {{gateway}}/api/inventory/4

### 6. Place an order: starts the saga, returns 201 with status PENDING
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 5, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

> {% client.global.set("orderId", response.body.id); %}

### 7. Follow the order (run it a few times: PENDING -> INVENTORY_RESERVED -> CONFIRMED)
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Order the $5,499 laptop: payment is declined, order becomes CANCELLED
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": 3, "quantity": 1 } ] }

### 9. The payment record for an order
GET {{gateway}}/api/payments/order/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Notifications created by notification-service from Kafka events
GET {{gateway}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Admin: create a product (inventory-service creates its stock via ProductCreatedEvent)
POST {{gateway}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SS-BOOK-003",
  "name": "Angular Signals Explained",
  "description": "Reactive state in modern Angular.",
  "category": "Books",
  "price": 29.99,
  "initialStock": 40
}

### 12. Admin: restock a product
POST {{gateway}}/api/inventory/4/restock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 10 }

### 13. Validation error example: 400 with field errors (RFC 7807 ProblemDetail)
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "not-an-email", "password": "short", "fullName": "" }

### 14. No token: the gateway answers 401 before the request reaches order-service
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders
